{{Passive skill box|Magmatic Strikes}}

'''Magmatic Strikes''' is a [[notable passive skill]] that grants a portion of your [[physical damage]] as extra [[fire damage]] for 4 seconds every 10 seconds. This effect does not scale with [[duration]].

